            <note corresp="#d122-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d122-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 764.00/10–2656. Confidential; Niact; Limit Distribution. The time of
                    transmission is not legible on the source text. Drafted by Dulles. Repeated to Paris.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d122-f2" n="2" xml:id="d122-f2-content">
